<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1787930229"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:30.805"><div begin="18.309" end="47.991" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="18.309" end="24.884" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.309" end="18.650">落</span><span begin="18.650" end="19.246">日在</span><span begin="19.246" end="19.793">喧</span><span begin="19.793" end="20.950">哗</span> <span begin="22.406" end="22.647">染</span><span begin="22.647" end="23.343">红了</span><span begin="23.343" end="23.869">窗</span><span begin="23.869" end="24.884">纱</span></p><p begin="25.468" end="31.747" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.468" end="25.739">打</span><span begin="25.739" end="26.458">几次</span><span begin="26.458" end="27.570">卡</span> <span begin="28.255" end="28.770">挤地</span><span begin="28.770" end="29.557">铁漂</span><span begin="29.557" end="30.201">流回</span><span begin="30.201" end="31.747">家</span></p><p begin="34.557" end="41.159" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.557" end="35.192">租住</span><span begin="35.192" end="36.047">的大</span><span begin="36.047" end="37.216">厦</span> <span begin="38.599" end="39.248">攒几</span><span begin="39.248" end="40.211">年筹</span><span begin="40.211" end="41.159">码</span></p><p begin="41.693" end="47.991" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.693" end="42.013">才</span><span begin="42.013" end="42.700">能留</span><span begin="42.700" end="44.067">下</span> <span begin="44.550" end="45.080">不去</span><span begin="45.080" end="45.475">想</span><span begin="45.475" end="46.515">下次搬</span><span begin="46.515" end="47.991">家</span></p></div><div begin="49.297" end="1:04.244" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="49.297" end="53.107" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.297" end="49.692">幸</span><span begin="49.692" end="50.157">福</span><span begin="50.157" end="50.815">啊</span> <span begin="50.815" end="51.235">没</span><span begin="51.235" end="52.058">有规</span><span begin="52.058" end="53.107">章</span></p><p begin="53.441" end="56.898" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.441" end="54.057">租的</span><span begin="54.057" end="56.036">未必不漫</span><span begin="56.036" end="56.898">长</span></p><p begin="57.212" end="1:04.244" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.212" end="58.435">只</span><span begin="58.435" end="59.741">是</span> <span begin="1:01.305" end="1:02.657">多</span><span begin="1:02.657" end="1:04.244">想</span></p></div><div begin="1:04.847" end="1:21.876" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:04.847" end="1:09.961" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.847" end="1:05.858">能给</span><span begin="1:05.858" end="1:06.432">她</span><span begin="1:06.432" end="1:09.370">一个不管多久都不会变动的</span><span begin="1:09.370" end="1:09.961">家</span></p><p begin="1:10.175" end="1:14.102" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.175" end="1:13.228">收留所有的流浪 不让她觉得</span><span begin="1:13.228" end="1:13.763">害</span><span begin="1:13.763" end="1:14.102">怕</span></p><p begin="1:14.277" end="1:18.125" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.277" end="1:16.359">这间房住过多少人</span> <span begin="1:16.359" end="1:17.851">梦过了多少理</span><span begin="1:17.851" end="1:18.125">想</span></p><p begin="1:18.135" end="1:21.876" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.135" end="1:18.680">故事</span><span begin="1:18.680" end="1:19.161">有</span><span begin="1:19.161" end="1:19.452">没</span><span begin="1:19.452" end="1:19.735">有</span><span begin="1:19.941" end="1:20.454">倒</span><span begin="1:20.454" end="1:21.876">塌</span></p></div><div begin="1:22.341" end="1:36.840" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:22.341" end="1:26.220" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.341" end="1:24.368">后来她都找到了吗</span> <span begin="1:24.368" end="1:25.692">曾经渴望的</span><span begin="1:25.692" end="1:26.220">家</span></p><p begin="1:26.473" end="1:30.187" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.473" end="1:27.035">那个</span><span begin="1:27.035" end="1:28.490">人